<title>UK: Storehouse year profit up 8.9 percent.</title>
<headline>Storehouse year profit up 8.9 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>52 weeks to March 30 1997.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		19.4		   vs 17.5</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.8		    vs 4.2</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 8.1		    vs 7.2</p>
<p> Pretax preexceps	 118.3		  vs 108.7</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,249.7		vs 1,083.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 117.5 and 121.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Storehouse Plc</p>
